# PrivacyDots: steps from parity/shell_modules_menubar_PrivacyDots.qml.md (batches 1-5). Screen TESSERA-TEST 1920x1080 scale 1;
# the island is centred at x 960 (closed y ~14, open ~392 wide); the bar is 30 px tall.
# Each block runs in both looks: the file runs top to bottom, Material first, then Glass.

look material
setup sh -c 'sleep 0.5; pw-record /dev/null' &
rec dot-in 1.5 ptr move 1500 600
note the orange dot pops in (200 ms OutBack)
shot dots
note Glass: dots; Material: a tertiary chip with icons; find its x
ptr glide 1700 15 200
wait 1
shot no-tip
note no tip

look glass
setup sh -c 'sleep 0.5; pw-record /dev/null' &
rec dot-in 1.5 ptr move 1500 600
note the orange dot pops in (200 ms OutBack)
shot dots
note Glass: dots; Material: a tertiary chip with icons; find its x
ptr glide 1700 15 200
wait 1
shot no-tip
note no tip
